# Local checks\n\n- Verilator lint: pass.\n- Formal: pass, 53 passed and 0 failed, using the nret=1 auto-selected wrapper\n  and checks.\n- Cosim: pass for both selftest and CoreMark, including random bus stalls and\n  CoreMark CRC validation (`NRET=1 make cosim TARGET=bench`).\n- Gowin timing: 50.597 MHz, 13 logic levels; reported worst path is register\n  file/forwarding through EX ALU to the data-memory address.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
