essure holds for the deeper pipeline.\"\n{\"type\":\"thread.started\",\"thread_id\":\"01a0ecab-3f2e-7e62-a0f5-dba76933557f\"}\n{\"type\":\"turn.started\"}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"I’ll review prior structural experiments and the current timing bottleneck, then write the hypothesis file with the required ID.\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_1\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -c \\\"if [ -f cores/bench/LESS\n…[39349 of 42421 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:0f9b18e3eb76e03c]…\n1s2.last\\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260929-002-r1s1.log\\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260929-003-r1s2.log\\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260929-002-r1s1.yaml\\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260929-002-r1s1.last\\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260929-001-r1s0.last\\ncores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260929-001-r1s0.log\\nname: bench\\ndescription: Frozen LLM-benchmark fixture core. Identical RTL to baseline at the bench-fixture-v1\\n  freeze point. The benchmark matrix clones from the bench-fixture-v1 orphan branch\\n  and operates only on this directory.\\nisa: rv32im\\nnret: 1\\ntarget_fpga: tang-nano-20k\\ntargets:\\n  fmax_mhz: 135\\n  lut4: 10000\\n  coremark_iter_s: 300\\n  coremark_per_mhz: 2.2\\ncurrent:\\n  fmax_mhz: 5.442\\n  lut4: 12312\\n  ff: 460\\n  coremark_iter_s: 2.0e-06\\n  coremark_per_mhz: 0.0\\n  source_id: baseline-bench-d64d0b9\\n  updated: '2026-09-29T10:17:20.837673Z'\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
