g.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Discard stale-epoch tokens before redirect generation, divider activity, or EX/MEM side effects.\"\n  - file: rtl/hazard_unit.sv\n    description: \"Qualify load-use and stall decisions with the fetched token's validity and epoch.\"\n/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-luna_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20260929-002-r10s1-hypgen\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
