lues are forwardable, preserving memory-stall and redirect priorities.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Route ID branch redirects to fetch and keep ID-resolved branches in the pipeline for retirement.\"\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: \"Accept the earlier branch redirect and discard the fetched wrong-path instruction.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Use the carried branch result for redirect metadata and alignment-trap behavior.\"\n?? experiments/\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
